{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1000_p", "source_sha256": "a78e8855165519b0318499c3b777d1636116f08b69935aab56a7a7982c959b9a", "ja": "（本番直前のこの雰囲気……\n初公演ともなると、空気の張りつめ方が違うな）", "zh": "（正式上场前的氛围……\n而且还是首次公演，气氛更是格外紧绷。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "5e203b7fca45d76cd8f739c3e5a01b6f7f0142bb7ca3982c09c75cea5540baf5", "ja": "ねぇ、兄ちゃん……ヅラ、持ってない？", "zh": "话说，大哥哥……你有假发吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2e2a7ede65054faaf7d642a9b6314bbfb6408c16995bcbc3d05b3ff8e14b2502", "ja": "も、持ってるわけないだろ。\nというか、なんでそんなものが必要なんだ？", "zh": "我、我怎么可能有啊。\n话说，为什么需要那种东西啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "cbf6ad1d9abd1e46681242b27d0b278b9ca6ccce80a2b33e064ea15c23fee5f4", "ja": "だって。\n真美、心配なんだよ～……。", "zh": "因为啊，\n真美很担心啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1004_p", "source_sha256": "b4b256e5c93644125341e7ecca115cfb3068d68128d351ddf9e44e1a11fa03e1", "ja": "何がだ？\nまさか、ここに来て社長の頭髪が急激に……？", "zh": "担心什么？\n该不会事到如今，社长的头发突然……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "9ef5dcb64c098826960d1de2ec8eab3c82c7540d62d69e044ef3e4119ac4b6b5", "ja": "んも～、違うってば～！　コーハイのみんなが、\nメッチャ緊張しちゃってるっぽいんだよ～！", "zh": "真是的～不对啦～！\n后辈她们感觉很紧张啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "49a9eaac51237e322581cb48d457ea6553a8b7d217e4d1a3b937cd3bc3002a90", "ja": "だから、いざって時は真美が入れ替わろうかなって。\n初公演で失敗したら、カワイソウっしょ？", "zh": "所以真美想说万一有需要的话，可以跟她们交换身分。\n毕竟首次公演要是失败了，就太可怜了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1007_012mam", "source_sha256": "abee8bc2f0ccc66c6a2cb6591bb73c31b1ab134e3d5134a465947c6b9a194d65", "ja": "真美なら、亜美とチョイチョイ入れ替わってたから、\nなんとかなると思ったんだけど……。", "zh": "真美三不五时会跟亚美互换身分，\n应该行得通的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "c7f968128506ceec1659715658d0e986e88a305c0c9b7d18e79bb11cf0163212", "ja": "よく考えたら、顔が真美とおんなじなのって\n亜美だけなんだよね。それで……。", "zh": "但仔细想想，脸长得跟真美一样的人，\n就只有亚美呢。所以说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1009_p", "source_sha256": "f61931e16d4f6bf2f10de0571c52e891ff2e3c7fb5db305b38a1449d26cce041", "ja": "真美、それはいくらなんでも……。", "zh": "真美，这主意实在……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "dd60d474fda836490ca34c5fec3bda591752a09837694183bce136b7b5de75c0", "ja": "でも大丈夫！　真美、モノマネはトクイだから！\nあ、見てて見てて？", "zh": "不过没问题！因为真美很擅长模仿！\n啊，你看看你看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "adbc82928c5a17db74bdff577f0c86a63c0294bdd8836500668b9c21263bdd77", "ja": "あらあら、ここはどこかしら～？", "zh": "哎呀哎呀，这里是哪里呢～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "c916ca1adff2cb4da5d1d22c93671065ad4cce59fea438ebe472733f9d4ffa2a", "ja": "……ね☆", "zh": "……对吧☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1013_p", "source_sha256": "65de125e15673c2d94e45fed409fa04106d7f7aca2649f03b24db87c1045eb2d", "ja": "確かに似てるけど、あずささんは後輩じゃないし……\nまさか、あずささんが緊張してるのか？", "zh": "确实很像啦，但梓小姐又不是后辈……\n该不会是梓小姐在紧张吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "77db11cdf3616f319f1c3bc047944229349e5a779468e36fac349a0da20d332b", "ja": "ううん！　あずさお姉ちゃんはフツーな感じだったよ。\nだから、緊張してるのはコーハイのみんな！", "zh": "不是！阿梓姊姊感觉跟平常一样喔。\n紧张的是后辈她们！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "45fb74a4cd0df67650e3148a08a25b1c91cac4533b3a6bf33c67090997febb16", "ja": "いくら真美でも、みんなの髪型は真似できないし……。\n兄ちゃん、ここにヅラをヅラーって並べて！", "zh": "就算是真美，也模仿不了大家的发型啊……\n大哥哥，现在就把假发都准备好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_1016", "source_sha256": "f24bfb8b602be25cfe0673e5571faed2406f28f148c114e1b0a2cf64c546873a", "ja": "落ち着かせる", "zh": "安抚她", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2000_p", "source_sha256": "74e6e0369c24affe2a4cef5ee355aaf1ea04558d6414d1551189a4aa9beb1b17", "ja": "なぁ、真美。心配する気持ちはわかるけど、\n緊張してる子の替え玉になるのは、よくないぞ。", "zh": "听着，真美。我明白你是在担心大家，\n但是去当紧张的人的替身，这样不好喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2001_012mam", "source_sha256": "28660ce754b24d5b11eadf26d0da8a1eac2913c2f71e1789c52a60aa13bcad88", "ja": "えーっ！？　名案なのに～？\nでもでも、失敗しちゃったら……。", "zh": "咦──！？明明是好办法吧～？\n可是可是，要是失败了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2002_p", "source_sha256": "dc41637a5fb5dd7e869993c0b1af4ed9ea2b6e5fdd30731e51f71cb281cc3264", "ja": "確かに、初公演で失敗したらかわいそうだっていう\n真美の気持ちはわかるよ。", "zh": "确实，我知道真美觉得要是在首次公演上失败，\n会很可怜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2003_p", "source_sha256": "6cb098fa8319730cb203b58b4efef5255ab3df79a6cf9559edf9f1714dc8fa0e", "ja": "でも、それも経験で、勉強のうちなんだ。\n失敗から学ぶものの方が、むしろ大事なんだから。", "zh": "但这也是一种经验，是一种学习。\n从失败中学到的东西，反而还比较重要呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2004_012mam", "source_sha256": "9374373e090974864757eb50e3fbd42a0474e9e4d4ece53e0cdada83dafc7e46", "ja": "うーん……でもさー……。", "zh": "嗯……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2005_p", "source_sha256": "f4bf7d50db280dcb1ac679dca6c05d19bb22ca9408f7534699e80184b40a3242", "ja": "真美も亜美の代わりじゃなく、真美自身として活動した\nことで、気がついたことがたくさんあるんじゃないか？", "zh": "真美在不是作为亚美的替身，而是\n以真美自己的身分活动时，也发现了很多道理吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2006_012mam", "source_sha256": "9fe548093ac600e4f0580308356beec513e14d710b94001562b41d12966d62b5", "ja": "真美が、真美として……？", "zh": "真美，以真美自己的身分……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2007_012mam", "source_sha256": "a3cd0544864ad1efd51e6aece8666a15f1f0f6afbf9ae7926de4533dbc7a2663", "ja": "うん……そうかも。\n亜美じゃなくて、今度は真美の名前だったし。", "zh": "嗯……好像是这样。\n因为这次不是亚美，是用真美的名字嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2008_012mam", "source_sha256": "07dc0a633aa8de0bf43c0b7aa54515fbb32ddce633b4140a50625ff0ffb4b416", "ja": "真美ひとりでやらなきゃいけなくなって、そんで……。\nわかったこと、たくさんあった……ような気がする。", "zh": "真美不得不一个人来，然后就……\n懂了很多事……的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2009_p", "source_sha256": "58da0b6972c18969556141e2e0b889bc2aef5fadc37778c5e59f8432d5f265b5", "ja": "ああ、真美と亜美は二人とも、\nそれぞれが自分で頑張ってたんだ。", "zh": "嗯，真美和亚美你们两人，\n都各自努力过了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2010_012mam", "source_sha256": "0261d158bda3c677453eddb3276c5e94cb1b87e741c4ff357e4c6815be11670e", "ja": "つまり……成功も失敗も、いろいろあったコト全部、\n今の真美のせくしーに繋がってるってコトだよね？", "zh": "意思是……不管成功或失败，\n过程中的种种都造就了真美的性感吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2012_p", "source_sha256": "a73ad6e1dc373e6e51ed59953cdc7e893207a9b4c458c098ac7522966d3a87f4", "ja": "まぁ、そういうことだ。", "zh": "嗯，就是那样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2013_012mam", "source_sha256": "9b166291f96f60f6a070cec79d22ff98b75b55adb52eb15413a675992f495c82", "ja": "わかったよ、兄ちゃん！　やっぱカワイソウだけど……\nシシは我が子を、変人の谷に突き落とすって言うし。", "zh": "知道了，大哥哥！虽然还是觉得很可怜……\n但毕竟狮子会把自己的小孩推下短芽绝壁嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2014_p", "source_sha256": "f9e4743219efba72d8550706693e7845466c9614e477aba31a61bef8383811ec", "ja": "……変人じゃなくて千尋の谷、な？", "zh": "……不是短芽绝壁，是断崖绝壁喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2015_012mam", "source_sha256": "cc352bcb4871f2b7c0277cd89162c074bedf006e26180f9a4905af119488217f", "ja": "そう、なんかそういう谷。だから真美、みんなのコト\n助けてあげたいけど……入れ替わるのはガマンするよ。", "zh": "对，就是那种壁。所以说真美虽然想帮大家……\n但会忍住不去跟她们交换身分的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2016_012mam", "source_sha256": "0485c43d33e3c1659a259cb8ec02de29082280c34f57996eae616f13087408ea", "ja": "真美は、先にその……エンジンの谷に飛び込んで、\nみんなを待ってるコトにする！　ブルンブルーン！", "zh": "真美会先跳进那个……断岩绝壁，\n在那里等着大家的！轰轰轰──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2017_012mam", "source_sha256": "95f50940472a8d217b221d67c2f91ea48a8d4c1de27cf9939dc5eb67d445dea3", "ja": "んじゃ、真美いってくんね！\n兄ちゃん、また後でね～♪", "zh": "那真美先走啰！\n大哥哥，待会再见～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2018_p", "source_sha256": "0d436a097dda5ca86a9aab3fcdbcc899646cba64b5765c496b705997cc8977d5", "ja": "（本物の千尋の谷にだって、この笑顔で飛び込む。\nそう感じるくらい、楽しそうな真美の笑顔……）", "zh": "（真美那开心的笑容，让人觉得就算是真正的断崖绝壁，\n她似乎也会带着这个笑容跳下去……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "memory_012mam_003_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_012mam_003_2019_p", "source_sha256": "f68362459078ded55a87325096c76412c4a2dfba133716aba502ee258ff6b9b4", "ja": "（真美の天真爛漫な明るさは、後輩を導く光……\nそして何より、真美自身を照らすのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（真美天真烂漫的开朗，是引导后辈的光芒……\n最重要的是，也可能会照亮真美她自己呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
